 "text": "Hey, nice to hear from you. How are you? Good you did. Tent steaks are great when you' camping, but they can dry out fast at home. Then keep the lid off the pot and turn the heat off. Let it cool down slowly, and the meat will stay moist. If it' really gusty, move the pot inside or put a lid on it. The wind can actually blow the sauce off the meat. Let him help. Pick the ones with the most flavour, and ask him to grab the biggest one. Maybe tell her it' prize from raffle. She loves a good prize, and it' already here.",
